@Observable BINDING (covenant #2): the web page holds NO state of its own (the manifest: "no API data
sources — renders from navigation values / local state"). Faithfully, the native page is pure chrome that
binds the embedded panel's @Observable `RegionSettingsModel` (the P1/S8 state holder) — NOT an empty stub
